<title>FRANCE: Matra - No comment on Aerospatiale complaint.</title>
<headline>Matra - No comment on Aerospatiale complaint.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lagardere declined to comment on Thursday on a complaint lodged against the company's Matra Defense subsidiary by state-owned Aerospatiale.</p>
<p>Aerospatiale claims Matra breached a longstanding cooperation agreement between the two French companies after it formed a missiles partnership with British Aerospace.</p>
</text>
